{{!
    @template mod_rememberme/session_complete

    Shown when nothing is due. This is not a failure state: a learner who is on
    top of their reviews has already met the week's requirement, so the message
    congratulates rather than nags.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * message String The explanation shown to the learner

    Example context (json):
    {
        "message": "You are up to date. Come back when more questions fall due; this week already counts as complete."
    }
}}
<div class="rememberme-complete text-center py-5">
    <div class="rememberme-complete-icon mb-3" aria-hidden="true">
        {{#pix}}i/checked, core{{/pix}}
    </div>
    <h3 class="h4">{{#str}}nothingdue, mod_rememberme{{/str}}</h3>
    <p class="text-muted">{{message}}</p>
</div>
